testdata/third_party/cldr-release-49/LICENSE and format/cldr/import/LICENSE.

5. Unicode Character Database
-----------------------------

internal/unicode/norm/tables.go is generated by tools/genucd from UnicodeData.txt and
DerivedNormalizationProps.txt of the Unicode Character Database, version 18.0.0
(https://www.unicode.org/Public/18.0.0/ucd/, fetched 2026-11-25; their SHA-256 are in the generated file's
header). testdata/third_party/unicode-18.0.0/NormalizationTest.txt is an unmodified copy of the same release's
file, used as a test fixture. Both are under the Unicode License v3, Copyright © 1991-2026 Unicode, Inc.; the
licence text is in testdata/third_party/unicode-18.0.0/LICENSE.

The YAKBD installers' icon (internal/relbuild/yakbd.ico) is the project's own drawing from yakbd/yakbd-gui
(packaging/windows/yakbd.ico, MIT-0, Copyright 2026 The YAKBD contributors).

